7. Why isEndOfWord Needed?

Suppose only:

cat

exists.

Trie:

root
 |
 c
 |
 a
 |
 t*

Search:

ca

Traversal succeeds:

root -> c -> a

But:

isEndOfWord == false

Therefore:

ca is not a word

Only a prefix.

8. Prefix Search

Search:

ca

Question:

Does any word start with "ca"?

Traverse:

root -> c -> a

Success.

Return:

true

No need to check isEndOfWord.

