The mental model I use:

Each node answers:

"What characters can come next?"

Root answers:

"What can be the first character of a word?"

Node 'c' answers:

"What can come after c?"

Node 'a' answers:

"What can come after ca?"

So yes, nodes keep references, but the references are to next character nodes, not entire words.
